     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I have a important question about the server location to <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792359758481000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dN_8AMDTuGAjwxMYg09XL\">shinyapps.io</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>We are a European Company with a new Data Protection law, and we want to use the <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792359758481000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dN_8AMDTuGAjwxMYg09XL\">shinyapps.io</a> with personal data, but if the serve who storage the data are located out of Europe we need the consents of all people.</div><div><br></div><div>The question is:</div><div><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><b>We can choose the location of <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792359758481000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dN_8AMDTuGAjwxMYg09XL\">shinyapps.io</a> servers when we use that service?  (we would need the servers in Europe).</b></div></blockquote><div><b><i><br></i></b></div><div><b><i>Best regards,</i></b></div><div><b><i>Carlos</i></b></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
